WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.380
Your best sentence deserves a careful check.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.330
Capital at the start.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.080
Names capitalized.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.960
Commas where they join or separate.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.840
Quotation marks around exact words.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.860
An end mark that fits.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.000
Then read it out loud one last time.
